Package: moultR
Title: Summarise and Plot Bird Moult Card Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Fer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "farcego@gmail.com")
Description: Tools to organise, summarise, and plot bird moult data
    collected in standard moult cards. The package includes schematic
    wing diagrams for visualising wing/tail moult extent and functions
    to prepare moult card records for further analysis.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
